[(Here we use this principle to make a harpsichord-like sound by)]
[(sending pulses into a recirculating delay line \050which imitates)]
[(the travel of the wave up and down the harpsichord string.\051)]
[(This is related to Karplus-Strong synthesis, but the idea is)]
[(probably much older than their paper.)]
